# AutoSwarm Sandbox Environment Configuration
#
# This is a disposable repository for testing AutoSwarm autonomous agent workflows.
# Currently no application code exists, so no environment variables are required.
#
# Setup Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Fill in variables as agent workflows are added
# 3. Never commit .env file to version control

# ============================================
# AutoSwarm Agent Configuration (Future)
# ============================================

# When agent workflows are added, they will likely need:
# SELVA_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
# SELVA_API_KEY=<your-autoswarm-api-key>

# ============================================
# LLM Provider (Future)
# ============================================

# OPENAI_API_KEY=<your-openai-api-key>
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=<your-anthropic-api-key>

# ============================================
# Quick Start
# ============================================
#
# This repo is a sandbox for testing. See README.md for details.
# As agent workflows are implemented, update this file with
# their required configuration.
